   1:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c **** /**
   2:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @file
   3:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol client
   4:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
   5:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @defgroup dhcp4 DHCPv4
   6:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @ingroup ip4
   7:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * DHCP (IPv4) related functions
   8:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * This is a DHCP client for the lwIP TCP/IP stack. It aims to conform
   9:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * with RFC 2131 and RFC 2132.
  10:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
  11:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @todo:
  12:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * - Support for interfaces other than Ethernet (SLIP, PPP, ...)
  13:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
  14:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * Options:
  15:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @ref DHCP_COARSE_TIMER_SECS (recommended 60 which is a minute)
  16:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @ref DHCP_FINE_TIMER_MSECS (recommended 500 which equals TCP coarse timer)
  17:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
  18:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * dhcp_start() starts a DHCP client instance which
  19:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * configures the interface by obtaining an IP address lease and maintaining it.
  20:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
  21:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * Use dhcp_release() to end the lease and use dhcp_stop()
  22:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * to remove the DHCP client.
  23:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
  24:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @see LWIP_HOOK_DHCP_APPEND_OPTIONS
  25:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @see LWIP_HOOK_DHCP_PARSE_OPTION
  26:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
  27:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @see netifapi_dhcp4
  28:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  */
  29:Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c **** 
